  "regressions": [
    "A clean default-feature native test/build reproduced unresolved WebGPU imports and generic buffer type errors in pinned khal after the optional-feature split.",
    "The default Metal adapter now explicitly enables khal/webgpu, matching the former transitive feature set. Clean native tests and strict all-target clippy pass.",
    "CPU scene-upload remains --no-default-features and does not activate Metal or WebGPU."
  ],
  "differences": [
    "Dependency feature configuration only; no Rust or TileLang physics arithmetic changed.",
    "The first 0075 registered attempt passed all six C and Ascend source cases but Metal failed during adapter build. That attempt is not three-target qualification. All targets must be rerun against this fix.",
    "Ascend source lowering remains distinct from vendor compilation and execution."
  ]
